                                                "sense_id": "0d223394-b80f-30c2-9fde-97f10cfad937",
                                                "text": "When it comes to Argentina, [Javier Milei's] model is the 1990s, when the convertibility plan established by President Carlos Menem pegged the peso to the dollar and completely ended hyperinflation."
